Z||000000||AkursedX||12-16-2001||03:21 PM||||Well finally here are the pics of my winter ride.  <P>This is what it started out as: <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8280010.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8280013.JPG"> <P>Here are shots of all of the rot in the wheelwell area.  (This is after the sand blasting) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8280004.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8280008.JPG"> <BR>More pics coming......||||reg||1
Z||000001||AkursedX||12-16-2001||03:27 PM||||This is the new fender.  The underneath of that was sandblasted and painted as well.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P9220028.JPG"> <P>Here are the pics of the rewelded, and re-sheet-metaled area after painting.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P9220024.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P9220026_1.JPG"> <P>The battery tray area, and the area near the air cleaner assembly were also sandblasted and got new sheetmetal||||reg||1
