Z||000009||Neal||12-16-2001||10:24 PM||||Looks great, nice job on the repairs!<P>I have a questin about the sand blasting, did you pay someone to do it, or do it yourself?  What gets used for the actual job?<P>Im used to media blasting cabinets so the whole sandblasting the underbody is new to me, wire brushes are however all to familiar...||||reg||1
Z||000010||artherd||12-16-2001||11:02 PM||||Looks *GREAT* man!  Glad to see another one resurected!<P>Wow, that was some rust....  thank goodness we have plastic body pannels!<P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
